T:If God Had Not Been on Our Side
T:WAER GOTT NICHT MIT ANS DIESE ZEIT 1524
C:Music: from Walter's Geistliche Gesangbüchlein, 1524 · Words: Martin Luther, 1524. Translation composite
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: Translation is public domain per Project Wittenberg: http://www.iclnet.org/pub/resources/text/wittenberg/hymns/ourside.txt. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/war_gott_nicht_mit_uns) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
